    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digital Pets</h2><strong>Ultra Auto Gotchimon</strong> is a game with <strong>digital pets </strong>that sit on top of your screen, enabling you to care for your creatures effortlessly while multitasking. If you crave a more immersive experience, dive into strategic auto-battles, where you strategically select moves, navigate procedurally generated regions, and evolve your creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.poster.avif?t=1745747258\" width=508 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.webm?t=1745747258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.mp4?t=1745747258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Multitasking</h2><strong>Multitasking</strong> seamlessly\u2014whether you're engaging in creature battles while watching YouTube or opting to magnify the game for a focused experience. Enjoy the flexibility to resize, move, and click through the game, maintaining its overlay presence. Immerse yourself in a world of synergies, unique typings, and evolving strategies in this auto-battler/virtual pet simulation hybrid.<br><br>Craft the perfect combination of moves and types by<strong> fusing moves together to create multi-typed moves</strong>, and train your Gotchi to adopt new typings.<br><br>Embark on a journey through procedurally generated regions with random events and battles, all while leveling up your Gotchi.<br><br>Show your Gotchi some love by <strong>taking care of it\u2014feed it, play with it, and keep it happy</strong>. They'll be your loyal companions while you work, watch TV, or attend to other tasks. Collect all 19 unique Gotchis and create your ultimate team!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Digital Pets</h2><strong>Ultra Auto Gotchimon</strong> is a game with <strong>digital pets </strong>that sit on top of your screen, enabling you to care for your creatures effortlessly while multitasking. If you crave a more immersive experience, dive into strategic auto-battles, where you strategically select moves, navigate procedurally generated regions, and evolve your creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.poster.avif?t=1745747258\" width=508 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.webm?t=1745747258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2763570/extras/27a0a5f7394b1cb7b37b83ba37e7629e.mp4?t=1745747258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Designed for Multitasking</h2><strong>Multitasking</strong> seamlessly\u2014whether you're engaging in creature battles while watching YouTube or opting to magnify the game for a focused experience. Enjoy the flexibility to resize, move, and click through the game, maintaining its overlay presence. Immerse yourself in a world of synergies, unique typings, and evolving strategies in this auto-battler/virtual pet simulation hybrid.<br><br>Craft the perfect combination of moves and types by<strong> fusing moves together to create multi-typed moves</strong>, and train your Gotchi to adopt new typings.<br><br>Embark on a journey through procedurally generated regions with random events and battles, all while leveling up your Gotchi.<br><br>Show your Gotchi some love by <strong>taking care of it\u2014feed it, play with it, and keep it happy</strong>. They'll be your loyal companions while you work, watch TV, or attend to other tasks. Collect all 19 unique Gotchis and create your ultimate team!",
    "short_description": "Level up multitasking with digital pets on your screen. Immerse in auto-battles, fuse moves for unique tactics, and care for virtual pets while leveling them up. This unique creature collection auto-battler plays as an overlay \u2013 your perfect companion for work and entertainment!",
